MARKET DATA

Historical prices are retrieved at runtime from Yahoo Finance's public chart
endpoint. That data is not redistributed with this project and remains subject
to Yahoo's terms of use. Users are responsible for their own compliance.

The bundled share-count table (internal/market/assets/shares_outstanding.csv)
is approximate reference data compiled for this project from public filings and
company disclosures. See the header of that file for its accuracy caveats.
